00:59:23.226 --> 00:59:24.477
<font color="white">Of course.</font><font color="white"></font>

699
00:59:24.561 --> 00:59:25.395
<font color="white">She's a level eight.</font><font color="white"></font>

700
00:59:25.478 --> 00:59:26.813
<font color="white">Wow. level eight?</font><font color="white"></font>

701
