703
00:59:31.109 --> 00:59:31.943
<font color="white">Hey. Kim.</font><font color="white"></font>

704
00:59:37.532 --> 00:59:39.867
<font color="white">Hey. why are there so many boxes?</font><font color="white"></font>

705
