01:02:30.580 --> 01:02:31.789
<font color="white">You like it too.</font><font color="white"></font>

777
01:02:32.290 --> 01:02:34.041
<font color="white">One more salmon. please.</font><font color="white"></font>

778
01:02:34.125 --> 01:02:36.127
<font color="white">Make it five. please.</font><font color="white">
